 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives the degree ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 " of the cochain ",
 StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"],
 ", one less than the number of vertices of the cliques on which it is \
stored.",
 "\n"
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"765b6434-d72e-47d7-aea2-bb23d6c907e3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 "-cochain takes its values on the (",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 " + 1)-cliques of a graph, the ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 "-simplices of its clique complex."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"8cc7a89c-e268-4d73-a618-3f22f3171562"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "It is stored as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"<|", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"v0", ",", " ", "\[Ellipsis]", ",", " ", "vk"}], "}"}], " ", "->",
      " ", "value"}], ",", " ", "\[Ellipsis]"}], "|>"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0eea6834-8e7b-4f31-888c-c96ebbed520b"],
 ", and the degree is read off a key. The empty cochain has no key and no \
degree."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"c094f609-f333-4ad8-9b77-e4fd38fbb645"],

